        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asingenzi ukuphinga njengabanye babo abenza ukuphinga, bafa ngasuku lunye baba zinkulungwane ezingamatshumi amabili lantathu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.1+NUM.25.2+NUM.25.3+NUM.25.4+NUM.25.5+NUM.25.6+NUM.25.7+NUM.25.8+NUM.25.9+NUM.25.10+NUM.25.11+NUM.25.12+NUM.25.13+NUM.25.14+NUM.25.15+NUM.25.16+NUM.25.17+NUM.25.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 25:1–18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asingayilingi iNkosi njengabanye babo bayilinga, babhujiswa zinyoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 21:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lingasoli njengabanye babo basola, babhujiswa ngumbulali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.16.41+NUM.16.42+NUM.16.43+NUM.16.44+NUM.16.45+NUM.16.46+NUM.16.47+NUM.16.48+NUM.16.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nani 16:41–49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lezizinto zabehlela bona kube yisixwayiso kwabanye; zalotshelwa ukusilaya thina osekufike kithi ukucina kwesikhathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakhoke lowo osuka athi umi, kaqaphele ukuba angawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalifikelwanga yikulingwa okungejwayelekanga ebantwini. UNkulunkulu uthembekile, kayikuvuma ukuba lilingwe ngokungaphezu kwamandla enu; kodwa nxa ukulingwa kufika, uzakulinika indlela yokuphepha, ukuze libe lamandla okukuthwala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
